  "content": "\n\n<h1>Access Denied API</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/access-denied-api\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cf.way2muchnoise.eu/917449.svg?badge_style=for_the_badge\" alt=\"CurseForge\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fproject%252faccessdeniedapi\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Modrinth-NA?style=for-the-badge&logo=modrinth&logoColor=000000&color=00AF5C\" alt=\"Modrinth\"></a> <a href=\"https://discord.gg/d9QGPrG7bn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Discord-NA?style=for-the-badge&logo=discord&logoColor=000000&color=5865F2\" alt=\"Discord\"></a></p>\n<p>Access Denied 是一款 Minecraft 模组，允许服务器管理员或整合包开发者禁用对游戏维度的访问，或设置自定义要求，玩家必须完成这些要求才能进入。</p>\n<p>该 API 允许开发者为 Access Denied 创建插件（Addons），最常见的用途是创建自定义要求。\n请参阅维基以获取开发者文档。</p>\n<blockquote>\n  <p><a href=\"https://github.com/WereF0X/access-denied-api/wiki\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">开发者文档</a></p>\n</blockquote>",
